<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσσῠφ-ος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόττῠφος</span></b> , ὁ (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσσυκος</span></b> ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Gloss.), blackbird, Turdus
				merula</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μὲν ἕτερος μέλας, . . ὁ δ᾽ ἕτερος
					ἔκλευκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					617a11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξῆς κ. ἦλθε μόνος γεύσασθαι ἕτοιμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Matro
					<u>Conv.</u>
					87
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				4.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.142
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.76
			</span></i> (Antip.), <i><span class="en">
				343
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>); 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόψιχος</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a sea-fish,
				<i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.718
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάγχρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Numen.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.305c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁθαλάττιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					1.14s
				</span></i>
			q. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> name of a
			peculiar breed of poultry at Tanagra, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.22.4
			</span></i>.</div>
